  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4004.03 Reporting Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4004.03 Reporting Requirements.\n\n(a) Each manufacturer subject to Env-A 4004.01 shall file with the department a written explanation of both the manufacture or representative date and representative code.\n\n(b) Each manufacturer shall file the explanation specified in (a), above, no later than:\n\n(1) The later of 3 months after the effective date of this chapter or within 3 months of production; and\n\n(2) Within 3 months after any change in coding.\n\nSource. #8358, eff 5-26-05; ss by #9064, eff 1-9-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4000.html"
}
